OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolanski banned from Israel after
OL,4,Aparty's motion declaring 'Zionism is
OL,5,Aracism'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolanski did not take part in the vote
OL,8,Fon Sunday. The motion, which has has
OL,9,Fdivided senior party figures, defines
OL,10,FZionism as an ideology supporting "an
OL,11,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,12,Fbacks a "single democratic Palestinian
OL,13,Fstate in all of historic Palestine".
OL,15,FIt has been criticised by some Jewish
OL,16,Fgroups, who called the motion an
OL,17,F"attack on the Jewish community".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
