OL,3,AProtesters gather as migrants brought
OL,4,Aashore on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters have gathered in a south
OL,7,Fcoast town as more than 100 people
OL,8,Fbelieved to be migrants were brought
OL,9,Fashore after crossing the Channel in a
OL,10,Fsmall boat.
OL,12,FA number of people were seen arriving
OL,13,Fat a marina in Gosport, Hampshire,
OL,14,Fhaving been transported aboard two RNLI
OL,15,Fboats late on Sunday. Their dinghy
OL,16,Fappeared to have set off from near Utah
OL,17,FBeach in Normandy during the morning,
OL,18,Faccording to ship tracking data.
OL,20,FFrench media reported there were about
OL,21,F120 migrants on board.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
