OL,3,AProtesters gather as migrants brought
OL,4,Aashore on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire Police said it deployed
OL,7,Fofficers to "support our partners in
OL,8,Fthe event of an emergency at sea". The
OL,9,Fforce imposed conditions under the
OL,10,FPublic Order Act as well as powers
OL,11,Fprohibiting the wearing of face
OL,12,Fcoverings.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
